<title>JAPAN: NTT falls sharply on earnings forecast.</title>
<headline>NTT falls sharply on earnings forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp (NTT) fell sharply on the Tokyo Stock Exchange on Friday afternoon after the company announced earnings and capital investment forecasts.  </p>
<p>The sales forecasts for 1996/97 were total revenues including operating and non-operating revenues, while previous and actual sales data for 1995/96 covered sales alone.</p>
</text>
